// 2011's music player list (cache 786): each track by its index (playbutton),
// its name (enum 1345), its unlock (music.varp: musicmulti_<index / 32 + 1>,
// bit index % 32; none for 864-895, clientscript 837) and its song (enum
// 1351), by its midi.pack name or, where midi.pack names none, its id. The
// tracks the list shows (enum 1351 not silence, enum 1350 not hidden;
// clientscript 828), and one more a music region plays.

